{
  "mappings": [
    {
      "name": "process accepted (202, processing) -- by Notch Pay's trx. reference, cm.mobile and a +-prefixed number under data.phone",
      "priority": 10,
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "urlPathPattern": "/payments/trx\\.test_[0-9a-f-]{36}",
        "headers": {
          "X-Grant": {
            "matches": ".+"
          },
          "Authorization": {
            "matches": ".+"
          }
        },
        "bodyPatterns": [
          {
            "matchesJsonPath": {
              "expression": "$.channel",
              "equalTo": "cm.mobile"
            }
          },
          {
            "matchesJsonPath": {
              "expression": "$.data.phone",
              "matches": "^\\+237[0-9]{9}$"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 202,
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json"
        },
        "body": "{\"code\":202,\"status\":\"Accepted\",\"message\":\"Payment is being processed\",\"transaction\":{\"reference\":\"{{request.pathSegments.[1]}}\",\"trxref\":\"{{regexExtract request.path '[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}'}}\",\"amount\":5000,\"amounts\":{\"converted\":5000,\"currency\":\"XAF\",\"rate\":1,\"total\":5000},\"currency\":\"XAF\",\"status\":\"processing\"}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "why": [
          "Process, addressed by Notch Pay's own reference (trx.test_<our reference> in this stub), as",
          "Notch Pay's sandbox required on 2026-10-21: it answered 404 to a process call by our reference",
          "(RFC-0012 section 10 item 2; docs/status/verification/2026-10-21-notchpay-sandbox-run.md). An adapter",
          "that addressed it by ours matches nothing and gets WireMock's 404, which is Malformed on a process",
          "call. The answer names our reference as trxref and carries no id, as the sandbox's did.",
          "data.phone and cm.mobile were accepted by the sandbox."
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
